+// ensureCredentialLink fix-first ensures one wanted credential link (§7.4,
+// §10.1): an absent link path is linked, a recorded symlink still
+// targeting the declared native store is left alone, and an empty
+// directory is replaced by the link. Anything else — a regular file, a
